upstream sha256 2a72e0acf2d5cb02b65ab99723e72faa8d786180f916048da7a78c831dbc7222

Patched: ELF e_flags 0x50001004 -> 0x50001404 (EF_MIPS_NAN2008, one byte at offset 37).
The AD5X kernel (5.10, NaN2008 FPU) refuses legacy-NaN binaries with ENOEXEC, which
BusyBox reports as "line 1: syntax error: unexpected )". Go does not set the flag itself.
